      "instance_name": "speech_scene",
      "label": "Adolf Hitler giving a speech",
      "description": "Adolf Hitler, dressed in a military-style uniform, is captured mid-speech with his right arm raised in a Nazi salute. He is positioned in front of a large microphone, indicating a public address. The scene is framed to emphasize his commanding presence and the propagandistic nature of the event. The text overlay 'not all heroes wear capes' adds a sarcastic, ironic commentary, contrasting the heroic archetype with Hitler's historical role as a figure of extreme evil.",
