      "instance_name": "Superhero_Trope",
      "label": "Superhero Trope",
      "description": "A common cultural archetype in comic books and movies where heroes are often depicted wearing capes, possessing extraordinary abilities, and fighting for justice. The trope is used to symbolize idealized, noble, and selfless figures.",
