      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "Sarcastic_Ironic_Commentary",
      "label": "Sarcastic/Ironic Commentary",
      "description": "A rhetorical device used to convey the opposite of what is stated, often to mock or criticize. In this meme, the phrase 'not all heroes wear capes' is used ironically to contrast the heroic archetype with Hitler, implying he is not a hero despite his public persona.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
