      "instance_name": "Historical_Memory",
      "label": "Historical Memory",
      "description": "The collective remembrance of past events, especially those involving trauma, loss, or injustice. The memory of the Holocaust and World War II is crucial for understanding the moral and historical context of figures like Hitler.",
