      "instance_name": "Meme_Harmfulness",
      "label": "Meme Harmfulness",
      "description": "The potential for a meme to cause offense, trivialize serious historical events, or normalize harmful ideologies. This meme is considered harmful because it uses a symbol of extreme evil (Hitler) to make a point, potentially trivializing his historical role and the suffering he caused.",
