      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_1422af7b",
      "@type": "EmotionExpression",
      "instance_name": "sarcastic_irony",
      "label": "sarcastic ironic commentary",
      "description": "The emotion expressed is sarcasm and irony, conveyed through the juxtaposition of the text 'not all heroes wear capes' with the image of Adolf Hitler, a figure universally recognized as evil. The text is used ironically to mock the idea of Hitler being a hero, contrasting the heroic archetype with his historical role as a perpetrator of genocide.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
