      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Harmful",
      "description": "The meme uses a historically significant figure associated with genocide and atrocities to make a point, potentially trivializing his historical role and the suffering he caused. The juxtaposition of Hitler with the superhero trope is intended to be sarcastic but risks normalizing or minimizing the gravity of his actions.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_ad375b0d"
      },
